  "job_B9.1.3.1_20251003_114915": {
    "text": "\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a unge\u00f0yldegan, & on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan.\nOn o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00fea unge\u00f0yldegan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan.\n\u00d0\u00e6m unge\u00f0yldegum is to s\u00e6cganne \u00f0\u00e6tte hie ne agimeleasien \u00f0\u00e6t hie hiera mod gebridligen,\nSw\u00e6 hit oft gebyre\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t sio hatheortnes & seo hr\u00e6dwilnes \u00f0\u00e6t mod gebreng\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6m weorce \u00fee\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m him is to s\u00e6cgeanne \u00f0\u00e6t hie weor\u00f0a\u00f0 oft ascrencte on \u00f0\u00e6m scyfe \u00f0\u00e6re styringe hiera\nAc gif he \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6re styringe ne wi\u00f0stent, \u00f0onne gescent he \u00f0a godan weorc \u00fee he oft \u00e6r on\nAnd sw\u00e6 ungleawlice for \u00f0\u00e6m scyfe \u00f0\u00e6re styringe swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice towyrp\u00f0 \u00fea godan weorc \u00fee\nAnd \u00f0a ge\u00f0ylde \u00fee is modur & hierde ealra m\u00e6gena for \u00f0\u00e6m unwrence \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde forlett,\nHit is awriten on Paules bocum \u00f0\u00e6t sio Godes lufu sie ge\u00f0yld, & se \u00fee ge\u00f0yldig ne sie, \u00f0\u00e6t he\nFor \u00f0\u00e6m un\u00f0eawe \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde wier\u00f0 utadrifen sio fostermodur \u00e6lcre leornunga & \u00e6lces\nNe m\u00e6g he no ryhtlice ge\u00f0yld l\u00e6ran, buton he self ge\u00f0yldelice o\u00f0erra monna teonan ge\u00f0olige.\nHwilum eac gebyre\u00f0 for \u00f0\u00e6m un\u00f0eawe \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t mod wier\u00f0 gesticced mid \u00f0\u00e6re\nAnd he ne m\u00e6g ge\u00f0yldgian \u00f0\u00e6t he for \u00f0isse worlde sie forsewen, ac gif he hw\u00e6t digollice for\nAnd onginne\u00f0 \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t cy\u00f0an \u00f0onne he ne m\u00e6g ge\u00f0olian \u00f0\u00e6t hiene men forsion, ac geopena\u00f0\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m is awriten \u00f0\u00e6t betra bio se ge\u00f0yldega wer \u00f0onne se gilpna, for\u00f0\u00e6m\u00fee him bi\u00f0 liofre\nAc \u00f0\u00e6m gilpnan bi\u00f0 liofre \u00f0\u00e6t he secge on hiene selfne, gif he hw\u00e6t godes wat, ge \u00f0eah he nyte\nAc he forl\u00e6t \u00f0onne & towierp\u00f0 eall \u00fea godan weorc \u00fee he \u00e6r worhte, \u00f0onne he forl\u00e6t \u00f0a\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e ryhtlice beboden Ezechiele \u00f0\u00e6m witgan \u00f0\u00e6t he sceolde \u00f0one Godes alter\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m, gif se weobud ufan hol n\u00e6re, & \u00f0\u00e6r wind to come, \u00f0onne tostencte he \u00f0a lac.\nHw\u00e6t elles getacna\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t weobud buton rihtwisra monna saula?\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m\u00fee nu eal \u00f0\u00e6t se ryhtwisa to gode de\u00f0 eal hit bi\u00f0 broht to lacum beforan Godes eagum,\nHw\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t holh on \u00f0\u00e6m weobude buton godra monna ge\u00f0yld?\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m, \u00f0onne mon his mod geea\u00f0modega\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t he wi\u00f0erweardnesse & scande forbere, \u00f0onne\nHolh w\u00e6s beboden \u00f0\u00e6t sceolde beon on \u00f0\u00e6m weobude uppan, for\u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0\u00e6t wind ne meahte \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld sceal gehealdan \u00f0ara gecorenra monna mod, \u00f0\u00e6tte hit ne astyrige se\nWel hit w\u00e6s gecweden \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t holh sceolde beon on \u00f0\u00e6m weobude anre elne brad & anre elne\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Paulus: Bere eower \u00e6lc o\u00f0res byr\u00f0enne betweohxn eow, \u00f0onne gefylle\n\u00d0\u00e6t is \u00f0onne Godes \u00e6 \u00f0\u00e6t mon h\u00e6bbe lufe & ge\u00f0yld, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0onne fullfremma\u00f0 \u00f0a ane \u00fee hie ne\nGehieren \u00f0a unge\u00f0yldegan \u00f0ysne cwyde \u00fee awriten is: Betra bi\u00f0 se ge\u00f0yldega wer \u00f0onne se\nL\u00e6ssan sige h\u00e6f\u00f0 se se \u00f0a burhware ofercym\u00f0, for\u00f0on him bio\u00f0 fremde \u00f0a \u00fee he \u00f0\u00e6r hin\u00f0 &\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m bi\u00f0 se sige micle mara \u00f0e man mid ge\u00f0ylde gewin\u00f0, for\u00f0\u00e6m sio gesceadwisnes \u00f0onne\nGehieren \u00f0a unge\u00f0yldegan hw\u00e6t sio So\u00f0f\u00e6stnes cw\u00e6\u00f0 to his gecorenum, he cw\u00e6\u00f0: On eowrum\nSw\u00e6 we sint wunderlice gesceapene \u00f0\u00e6t ure mod & ure gewitt h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00f0one anwald ures\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m, gif sio gesceadwisnes n\u00e6f\u00f0 nanne anwald \u00f0\u00e6re saule & \u00f0\u00e6s modes, \u00f0onne n\u00e6f\u00f0 sio\nAc sio ge\u00f0yld is gesett to hierde urre gesceafte.\n\u00d0\u00e6t us \u00e6tiewde Dryhten, \u00fea he us l\u00e6rde \u00f0\u00e6t we sceoldon urra selfra waldan mid \u00f0\u00e6re ge\u00f0ylde.\nWe magon eac ongietan hu micel sio scyld bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde, \u00f0urh \u00fea we forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00f0one anwald\nGehieren \u00f0a unge\u00f0yldegan \u00f0one cwide \u00fee eft be him gecweden is on Salomones bocum: Se\nSio unge\u00f0yld geniet \u00f0one monnan \u00f0\u00e6t he geopena\u00f0 all his inge\u00f0onc, & ealne \u00f0one gast utadrif\u00f0.\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m hiene sw\u00e6 hr\u00e6dlice sio gedrefednes utadrif\u00f0 \u00f0y hiene \u00f0\u00e6rinne ne belyc\u00f0 nan ege \u00f0\u00e6re\nAc se wisa hilt his spr\u00e6ce & bitt timan, & ne wilna\u00f0 na to hr\u00e6dlice \u00f0\u00e6re wr\u00e6ce, \u00f0eah he\nAnd \u00f0eah wite he \u00f0\u00e6tte ealle scylda \u00fee wi\u00f0 God beo\u00f0 ungebetta beo\u00f0 unforgifne on domes\nAc eft sint to manigenne \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan \u00f0\u00e6tte \u00f0\u00e6t hie mid hiera wordum & mid hiera d\u00e6dum\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m, \u00f0onne hit nan man wietan ne m\u00e6g hw\u00e6\u00f0er hit eallinga forgiefen sie, \u00f0\u00e6tte hit \u00f0onne\nAc \u00f0\u00e6m ge\u00f0yldegan & \u00f0\u00e6m forgiefendan is to secganne \u00f0\u00e6t he georne wilnige \u00f0\u00e6t he \u00f0one\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Paulus: Lufu bi\u00f0 ge\u00f0yldig.\nAnd sona \u00e6fter \u00f0\u00e6m he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hio bi\u00f0 mildu.\nSwi\u00f0e sweotule he \u00e6tiewde mid \u00f0\u00e6m wordum \u00f0\u00e6tte \u00f0\u00e6m monnum \u00f0e we for ge\u00f0ylde hw\u00e6t\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m se \u00e6\u00f0ela lareow cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00f0a he spon his hieremen to \u00f0\u00e6re ge\u00f0ylde, he cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00c6lc \u00f0weora\n\u00d0a he spr\u00e6c, swelce he \u00fea uterran yflu h\u00e6fde eall gesett, & wende hiene \u00fea to \u00f0\u00e6m inneran, &\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m hit bi\u00f0 unnyt \u00f0\u00e6t mon unweor\u00f0unga & t\u00e6l & geclibs utane forl\u00e6te, gif se yfela willa\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m hit bi\u00f0 unnyt \u00f0\u00e6t mon hwelces yfles bogas sn\u00e6de, buton mon wille \u00f0a wyrtruman\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m sio So\u00f0f\u00e6stnes \u00f0urh hie selfe cw\u00e6\u00f0: Lufia\u00f0 eowre fiend, & do\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6m wel \u00fee eow \u00e6r\n\u00d0\u00e6t is swi\u00f0e micel cr\u00e6ft beforan mannum \u00f0\u00e6t mon \u00f0\u00e6m men auht forberan m\u00e6ge \u00fee him\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0a lac beo\u00f0 Gode ealra andfengeost \u00fee beforan his eagum se lieg \u00f0\u00e6re lufe forb\u00e6rn\u00f0 on\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m eft Dryhten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to sumum monnum \u00fee h\u00e6fdon \u00f0a ge\u00f0yld, & n\u00e6fdon \u00f0a lufe, he\nSio gedrefednes \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde on \u00f0\u00e6m mode \u00f0\u00e6t is se smala cii\u00f0, ac se yfela willa on \u00f0\u00e6re\n\u00d0one unge\u00f0yldegan \u00f0onne swi\u00f0e lytel scur \u00f0\u00e6re costunga m\u00e6g onhreran,sw\u00e6 sw\u00e6 lytel wind\nBe \u00f0\u00e6m cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft Dryhten: \u00d0u licettere, aweorp \u00e6rest of \u00f0inum agnum eagan \u00f0one greatan\nSwelce he cw\u00e6de to \u00f0\u00e6m unrhtwisan mode, \u00fee innan bi\u00f0 gnorniende, & utan licet ge\u00f0yld: Ado\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m, \u00f0onne \u00f0u ne wilnast \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u oferswi\u00f0e \u00f0one yfelan willan, & forl\u00e6te \u00f0a licettunge on\nAnd oft \u00f0eah gebyre\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6m ge\u00f0yldegan, \u00f0eah him mon hw\u00e6t wi\u00f0erweardes do, o\u00f0\u00f0e he hwelce\nAc \u00f0onne he hit eft ofman \u00e6fter lytlum f\u00e6ce, \u00f0onne of\u00f0ync\u00f0 him \u00f0\u00e6s ilcan \u00fee he \u00e6r forb\u00e6r, &\nSec\u00f0 \u00f0onne & smea\u00f0 hu he hit gewrecan m\u00e6ge, & \u00f0a man\u00f0w\u00e6rnesse \u00fee he \u00e6r \u00f0urhtogen h\u00e6fde\nAc \u00f0\u00e6m m\u00e6g bion swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6de geholpen from his lareowe, gif he him s\u00e6g\u00f0 hwonon \u00f0\u00e6t cym\u00f0,\nAc hit gebyre\u00f0 oftost \u00f0\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 oferswi\u00f0ed, se \u00fee \u00f0urh diofles lare \u00e6rest bi\u00f0 on\u00e6led mid \u00f0y\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 oftost \u00f0one weor\u00f0scipe se \u00fee \u00e6r ge\u00f0yldelice \u00fea scande forb\u00e6r.\nAc \u00f0onne se dioful h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00f0one \u00e6rran gewunnenne, & he bi\u00f0 under his geoc gegan, \u00f0onne went he\nAnd bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e sarig, for\u00f0\u00e6m\u00fee he on \u00f0\u00e6m forman gefeohte hiene ne meahte ofsceotan mid \u00f0\u00e6m\nL\u00e6t \u00f0onne an \u00f0\u00e6t gefeoht sw\u00e6 openlice sume hwile, & ongin\u00f0 hiene diegellice l\u00e6ran, & slitan\nFor\u00f0\u00e6m he hiene ne meahte mid openlicum gefeohte oferswi\u00f0an, s\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00f0onne digelice, & sec\u00f0\nSe ge\u00f0yldega \u00f0onne eft, \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t gestilled bi\u00f0, \u00f0onne went he eft ongean mid his mode, &\nAnd \u00f0onne swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice & swi\u00f0e ungemetlice eahta\u00f0 eall \u00f0\u00e6t him \u00e6r gedon w\u00e6s, & hit\nAnd mid sw\u00e6 micelre murcunga his agen mod gedref\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6tte oft \u00f0one ge\u00f0yldegestan scama\u00f0\nAnd he \u00f0onne sw\u00e6 gebunden from \u00f0\u00e6m diofle sarga\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s, & him of\u00f0ync\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t he hit sw\u00e6 emne\nAnd \u00f0enc\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s timan hwonne he hit wyrs geleanian m\u00e6ge.\nAc hw\u00e6m beo\u00f0 \u00f0onne \u00f0as \u00f0yllecan gelicran \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6m folce \u00fee on cl\u00e6num felda weor\u00f0licne\n\u00d0a ge\u00f0yldegan sint to manianne \u00f0\u00e6tte hie hiera heortan getrymmen \u00e6fter \u00f0\u00e6m miclan sige, & \u00fea\nAnd mid wighusum gef\u00e6stnige, swelce hie him \u00f0\u00e6re adle edcir swi\u00f0ur ondrede \u00f0onne \u00f0one",
